  "account": "锦绣千秋录",
  "source_title": "稻浪盘满一座山，金叶铺满石头村，一汪湖一天换好几色——中国秋天最惊艳的那处，凭什么排在雪山草甸前面？\n#中国秋天 #大美中国 #神州秋色",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 587.023991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光是哪一处吗？上集，咱们聊了额尔古纳湿地、张掖七彩丹霞、米亚罗、红叶、塔里木胡杨林、长白山天池尤一集，直接揭开谜底，看看前五名惊叹到什么奇景，尤其是排在榜首的那处奇景，不仅坐拥一天之内变换数种色泽的奇幻大湖，清晨更更能在峡谷间幻化出如梦似幻的流动成物。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，往西龙脊梯田、桂林龙盛梯田，您肯定见过。可龙脊的梯田是把一整座山都当成了田梯田，从海拔三百米，一路啃到一千一百米，层层叠叠往上爬。这些田是壮族和瑶族的先民，一锄头一锄头啃出来的，从元朝开始修到清朝，初年才成型。前后六百多年没有机器，全靠人手和牛力。秋收时节，稻子熟了，空气里一股新米的清香，满山一圈一圈的金像，一条金龙盘在山上，木楼点缀在山腰，晨雾一绕人，走在田埂上，就像走在云里，一座山养活了一代又一代人，您说这是不是诗话更是日子？第四名，广西桂林海洋银杏灵川海洋乡。说起金黄的银杏，您多半想到北方，可谁能想到，南方的石头山里藏着一片银杏的海，当地人说有上百万株银杏是活化石，两亿多年前就长在地球上。后来大多灭绝了中国，成了他最后的老家海洋乡的人，把他们种在房前屋后，白果换钱，叶子遮阴，一代传一代。十一月中下旬，叶子黄透了风一过，哗哗往下落。孙露田埂屋顶全铺成了金色，更绝得是树，后面是一座座喀斯特石峰，风青辉树金黄，这样的搭配一点也不像南方，您说这是不是最暖的一种惊叹？第三名，四川阿坝黄龙五彩池，落入人间的高原瑶池。他海拔三千五百多米，整整六百九十三个，盖花，彩池层层相叠，规模达两万多平方米。数万年富含矿物质的高山泉水，奔流沉积在山谷间，凝结成一道道天然的金色池梗。深秋十月四周群峰耸立，漫山红花与落叶松正值金黄，这片彩池便展现出惊世的华彩。由于池底沉淀与光线折射，水色，呈现出翠绿战。蓝明皇与墨子如同一颗颗宝石，坠入金黄山林清冽的高原，秋风吹过，水光潋滟，澄澈见底，把斑斓水色与丘陵交织的如此纯粹。您说这神仙手笔服不服？第二名，四川稻城亚丁甘孜稻城亚丁在藏语里，是向阳之地被，叫做最后的香格里拉。三座雪山品字形立着最高的鲜乃至六千多米央，麦勇和夏诺多吉也在五千九百米上下。藏族人把他们当成神山，冰川就挂在山腰。秋天阳光一打，反着一层冷冷的白光。山下是冲古草殿和落荣牛场。十月，草甸一片惊黄牦牛慢慢走过几个孩子，拦得像从天上掉下来的海拔四千多米，风里带着冰碴子的粮，可真站在那儿。人先觉得自己小冰川的白草甸的、金天的蓝压在一个画面里，好看两个字根本装不下。您说。站在这儿，谁还敢说自己大那第一名到底是哪？先别急，聊到到这，我先唠几句心里话，盘完这九处留言区有个事儿特别一致。好多朋友说年轻时候忙，没空出门，好在退休，有空了想去走走，可不知道先去哪儿去了。看什么高原的景，北国的景，身子骨去不了，有没有坐在家家里也能看明白的，还有带孙子孙女儿的更愁。孩子问咱这地方为什么叫这个名字？为什么到秋天会长成这样？可自己也说不全。您看咱们这个年纪看景，不光是图个热闹，更想知道这些大好河山到底是怎么来的。可这些东西在手机上画完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看的眼睛疼。前阵。那我翻到一本书正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成五块自然奇观，文明印记、烟火人间秘境，寻踪人间天堂。咱们今天聊的这些自然也都在里头，这些秋色是怎么形成的？有什么故事去了，该看哪几处什么季节去，最值几分钟。一个地方讲的明明白白，涂印的特别漂亮。一页翻开就是一幅画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不只是一片颜色，而是故事暂时去不了的，就着图文慢慢看，也算去过了。摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识不说，写作文也正好用得上。老两口晚上翻翻商量，明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完，可装在心里的山河眼界传几辈人都贬不了职，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代备一份书。就在左下角的商品里，感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，人暂时走不出去，咱先把大好河山装进屋里，好说回正题，第一名，新疆喀纳斯湖与月亮湾乘雾阿尔泰山深处。为什么是他？前面的风光各有各的绝活，有的靠颜色，有的靠雪山，有的靠池水，可喀纳斯把他们全装进了。同一个清晨，他在新疆阿勒泰地区布尔金县藏在阿尔泰山最深的山坳里，湖面四十多平方公里，水深一百八十多米。湖水是冰川融水汇成的，湖水里带着冰川磨出来的细粉，光线一换，林子，一黄水色也跟着换。一天里能变好几个颜色，当地图瓦人还世代传说，湖里有大怪兽。有有人说是一种叫折罗龟的大鱼，到今天也没个定论。九月底十月初，秋天，来的最早山坡上的白桦落叶松一起黄透金黄的林子沿着山坡铺到湖边。可真正最神的是，清早天没亮，透山谷里起的雾，一层一层从水面升上来，漫过湖，漫过林子湖和天分看不出边界。喀纳斯河在山谷里拐出一道月牙形的河湾，这就是月亮湾雾绕着河湾，金黄的林子从雾里露出头来。他排第一，不是比谁最高最大，而是因为只有他把冰川的水，原始的林河湾和晨雾一起留在了一个清晨里，十处绝美秋色讲完了，最后把问题交给您。这十处秋景您去过几处，最想去的是哪一处？评论区告诉我，刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品里就有爱看大好河山的朋友别错过，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样，爱看祖国山河的人，觉听更多华夏大地的绝美风景点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00001",
      "start_ms": 300,
      "end_ms": 4740,
      "text": "您知道中国秋天最令人惊叹的风光是哪一处吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5100,
      "end_ms": 5640,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5660,
      "end_ms": 15580,
      "text": "咱们聊了额尔古纳湿地、张掖七彩丹霞、米亚罗、红叶、塔里木胡杨林、长白山天池尤一集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00004",
      "start_ms": 15700,
      "end_ms": 17180,
      "text": "直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17520,
      "end_ms": 19820,
      "text": "看看前五名惊叹到什么奇景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20240,
      "end_ms": 23460,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那处奇景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00007",
      "start_ms": 24060,
      "end_ms": 28500,
      "text": "不仅坐拥一天之内变换数种色泽的奇幻大湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00008",
      "start_ms": 29200,
      "end_ms": 34630,
      "text": "清晨更更能在峡谷间幻化出如梦似幻的流动成物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00009",
      "start_ms": 35050,
      "end_ms": 35830,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00010",
      "start_ms": 36190,
      "end_ms": 37510,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00011",
      "start_ms": 38069,
      "end_ms": 39950,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00012",
      "start_ms": 40370,
      "end_ms": 41630,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00013",
      "start_ms": 41930,
      "end_ms": 42650,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00014",
      "start_ms": 43150,
      "end_ms": 47230,
      "text": "往西龙脊梯田、桂林龙盛梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00015",
      "start_ms": 47230,
      "end_ms": 48210,
      "text": "您肯定见过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48610,
      "end_ms": 54190,
      "text": "可龙脊的梯田是把一整座山都当成了田梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00017",
      "start_ms": 54290,
      "end_ms": 55630,
      "text": "从海拔三百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00018",
      "start_ms": 55750,
      "end_ms": 57490,
      "text": "一路啃到一千一百米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00019",
      "start_ms": 57930,
      "end_ms": 59370,
      "text": "层层叠叠往上爬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60180,
      "end_ms": 63630,
      "text": "这些田是壮族和瑶族的先民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63770,
      "end_ms": 65835,
      "text": "一锄头一锄头啃出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00022",
      "start_ms": 66320,
      "end_ms": 68940,
      "text": "从元朝开始修到清朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00023",
      "start_ms": 69020,
      "end_ms": 70155,
      "text": "初年才成型。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00024",
      "start_ms": 70970,
      "end_ms": 74075,
      "text": "前后六百多年没有机器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00025",
      "start_ms": 74690,
      "end_ms": 76365,
      "text": "全靠人手和牛力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00026",
      "start_ms": 76840,
      "end_ms": 77855,
      "text": "秋收时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00027",
      "start_ms": 78500,
      "end_ms": 79475,
      "text": "稻子熟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00028",
      "start_ms": 80320,
      "end_ms": 82615,
      "text": "空气里一股新米的清香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00029",
      "start_ms": 83350,
      "end_ms": 85930,
      "text": "满山一圈一圈的金像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00030",
      "start_ms": 85970,
      "end_ms": 87865,
      "text": "一条金龙盘在山上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88500,
      "end_ms": 90225,
      "text": "木楼点缀在山腰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90760,
      "end_ms": 92390,
      "text": "晨雾一绕人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00033",
      "start_ms": 92390,
      "end_ms": 93615,
      "text": "走在田埂上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00034",
      "start_ms": 93980,
      "end_ms": 95205,
      "text": "就像走在云里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95580,
      "end_ms": 98965,
      "text": "一座山养活了一代又一代人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00036",
      "start_ms": 99310,
      "end_ms": 102445,
      "text": "您说这是不是诗话更是日子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00037",
      "start_ms": 102890,
      "end_ms": 103570,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00038",
      "start_ms": 103850,
      "end_ms": 107465,
      "text": "广西桂林海洋银杏灵川海洋乡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00039",
      "start_ms": 108240,
      "end_ms": 110040,
      "text": "说起金黄的银杏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00040",
      "start_ms": 110260,
      "end_ms": 112215,
      "text": "您多半想到北方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00041",
      "start_ms": 112860,
      "end_ms": 114135,
      "text": "可谁能想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00042",
      "start_ms": 114560,
      "end_ms": 118425,
      "text": "南方的石头山里藏着一片银杏的海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119130,
      "end_ms": 123315,
      "text": "当地人说有上百万株银杏是活化石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00044",
      "start_ms": 124190,
      "end_ms": 126685,
      "text": "两亿多年前就长在地球上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127030,
      "end_ms": 129410,
      "text": "后来大多灭绝了中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129430,
      "end_ms": 132780,
      "text": "成了他最后的老家海洋乡的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132820,
      "end_ms": 134685,
      "text": "把他们种在房前屋后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00048",
      "start_ms": 135410,
      "end_ms": 136575,
      "text": "白果换钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00049",
      "start_ms": 137160,
      "end_ms": 138295,
      "text": "叶子遮阴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138970,
      "end_ms": 140395,
      "text": "一代传一代。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00051",
      "start_ms": 140830,
      "end_ms": 142375,
      "text": "十一月中下旬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00052",
      "start_ms": 142890,
      "end_ms": 145230,
      "text": "叶子黄透了风一过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00053",
      "start_ms": 145610,
      "end_ms": 146715,
      "text": "哗哗往下落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00054",
      "start_ms": 147430,
      "end_ms": 152115,
      "text": "孙露田埂屋顶全铺成了金色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00055",
      "start_ms": 152540,
      "end_ms": 154360,
      "text": "更绝得是树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00056",
      "start_ms": 154480,
      "end_ms": 157065,
      "text": "后面是一座座喀斯特石峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00057",
      "start_ms": 157500,
      "end_ms": 159795,
      "text": "风青辉树金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00058",
      "start_ms": 160500,
      "end_ms": 163455,
      "text": "这样的搭配一点也不像南方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00059",
      "start_ms": 164180,
      "end_ms": 167425,
      "text": "您说这是不是最暖的一种惊叹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00060",
      "start_ms": 167770,
      "end_ms": 168435,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00061",
      "start_ms": 168850,
      "end_ms": 171205,
      "text": "四川阿坝黄龙五彩池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00062",
      "start_ms": 171730,
      "end_ms": 173855,
      "text": "落入人间的高原瑶池。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00063",
      "start_ms": 174760,
      "end_ms": 176505,
      "text": "他海拔三千五百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00064",
      "start_ms": 177060,
      "end_ms": 178840,
      "text": "整整六百九十三个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00065",
      "start_ms": 178840,
      "end_ms": 179220,
      "text": "盖花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00066",
      "start_ms": 179240,
      "end_ms": 180935,
      "text": "彩池层层相叠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00067",
      "start_ms": 181340,
      "end_ms": 183245,
      "text": "规模达两万多平方米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183680,
      "end_ms": 186480,
      "text": "数万年富含矿物质的高山泉水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00069",
      "start_ms": 186600,
      "end_ms": 189670,
      "text": "奔流沉积在山谷间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00070",
      "start_ms": 189850,
      "end_ms": 192845,
      "text": "凝结成一道道天然的金色池梗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00071",
      "start_ms": 193330,
      "end_ms": 196825,
      "text": "深秋十月四周群峰耸立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00072",
      "start_ms": 197280,
      "end_ms": 200605,
      "text": "漫山红花与落叶松正值金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00073",
      "start_ms": 201200,
      "end_ms": 204715,
      "text": "这片彩池便展现出惊世的华彩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00074",
      "start_ms": 205150,
      "end_ms": 208025,
      "text": "由于池底沉淀与光线折射，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00075",
      "start_ms": 208640,
      "end_ms": 209240,
      "text": "水色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00076",
      "start_ms": 209280,
      "end_ms": 211230,
      "text": "呈现出翠绿战。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00077",
      "start_ms": 211230,
      "end_ms": 215660,
      "text": "蓝明皇与墨子如同一颗颗宝石，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00078",
      "start_ms": 215980,
      "end_ms": 219650,
      "text": "坠入金黄山林清冽的高原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00079",
      "start_ms": 219890,
      "end_ms": 220890,
      "text": "秋风吹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00080",
      "start_ms": 221270,
      "end_ms": 222365,
      "text": "水光潋滟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222730,
      "end_ms": 223655,
      "text": "澄澈见底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00082",
      "start_ms": 224070,
      "end_ms": 228405,
      "text": "把斑斓水色与丘陵交织的如此纯粹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00083",
      "start_ms": 228780,
      "end_ms": 230675,
      "text": "您说这神仙手笔服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00084",
      "start_ms": 231030,
      "end_ms": 231725,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00085",
      "start_ms": 232140,
      "end_ms": 237540,
      "text": "四川稻城亚丁甘孜稻城亚丁在藏语里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00086",
      "start_ms": 237540,
      "end_ms": 239210,
      "text": "是向阳之地被，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00087",
      "start_ms": 239210,
      "end_ms": 241225,
      "text": "叫做最后的香格里拉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00088",
      "start_ms": 241690,
      "end_ms": 247360,
      "text": "三座雪山品字形立着最高的鲜乃至六千多米央，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00089",
      "start_ms": 247360,
      "end_ms": 251015,
      "text": "麦勇和夏诺多吉也在五千九百米上下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00090",
      "start_ms": 251560,
      "end_ms": 253945,
      "text": "藏族人把他们当成神山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00091",
      "start_ms": 254360,
      "end_ms": 255965,
      "text": "冰川就挂在山腰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00092",
      "start_ms": 256440,
      "end_ms": 257805,
      "text": "秋天阳光一打，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00093",
      "start_ms": 258330,
      "end_ms": 260215,
      "text": "反着一层冷冷的白光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00094",
      "start_ms": 260680,
      "end_ms": 264255,
      "text": "山下是冲古草殿和落荣牛场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264750,
      "end_ms": 265210,
      "text": "十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00096",
      "start_ms": 265270,
      "end_ms": 270050,
      "text": "草甸一片惊黄牦牛慢慢走过几个孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00097",
      "start_ms": 270050,
      "end_ms": 274185,
      "text": "拦得像从天上掉下来的海拔四千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00098",
      "start_ms": 274710,
      "end_ms": 276875,
      "text": "风里带着冰碴子的粮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00099",
      "start_ms": 277370,
      "end_ms": 278525,
      "text": "可真站在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00100",
      "start_ms": 278790,
      "end_ms": 286355,
      "text": "人先觉得自己小冰川的白草甸的、金天的蓝压在一个画面里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286730,
      "end_ms": 289155,
      "text": "好看两个字根本装不下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289630,
      "end_ms": 290085,
      "text": "您说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00103",
      "start_ms": 290680,
      "end_ms": 291460,
      "text": "站在这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00104",
      "start_ms": 291900,
      "end_ms": 295060,
      "text": "谁还敢说自己大那第一名到底是哪？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00105",
      "start_ms": 295220,
      "end_ms": 295900,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00106",
      "start_ms": 296660,
      "end_ms": 297580,
      "text": "聊到到这，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00107",
      "start_ms": 297720,
      "end_ms": 299620,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00108",
      "start_ms": 300100,
      "end_ms": 304060,
      "text": "盘完这九处留言区有个事儿特别一致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304720,
      "end_ms": 307040,
      "text": "好多朋友说年轻时候忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00110",
      "start_ms": 307280,
      "end_ms": 308180,
      "text": "没空出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00111",
      "start_ms": 308880,
      "end_ms": 309860,
      "text": "好在退休，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00112",
      "start_ms": 310020,
      "end_ms": 311940,
      "text": "有空了想去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00113",
      "start_ms": 312380,
      "end_ms": 314400,
      "text": "可不知道先去哪儿去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00114",
      "start_ms": 314400,
      "end_ms": 316300,
      "text": "看什么高原的景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00115",
      "start_ms": 316640,
      "end_ms": 317440,
      "text": "北国的景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00116",
      "start_ms": 317840,
      "end_ms": 318960,
      "text": "身子骨去不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00117",
      "start_ms": 319400,
      "end_ms": 321770,
      "text": "有没有坐在家家里也能看明白的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00118",
      "start_ms": 322210,
      "end_ms": 324170,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女儿的更愁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00119",
      "start_ms": 324830,
      "end_ms": 327470,
      "text": "孩子问咱这地方为什么叫这个名字？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00120",
      "start_ms": 327950,
      "end_ms": 330450,
      "text": "为什么到秋天会长成这样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00121",
      "start_ms": 330870,
      "end_ms": 332250,
      "text": "可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00122",
      "start_ms": 332850,
      "end_ms": 335190,
      "text": "您看咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00123",
      "start_ms": 335310,
      "end_ms": 336850,
      "text": "不光是图个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00124",
      "start_ms": 337410,
      "end_ms": 341410,
      "text": "更想知道这些大好河山到底是怎么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00125",
      "start_ms": 341770,
      "end_ms": 345050,
      "text": "可这些东西在手机上画完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00126",
      "start_ms": 345090,
      "end_ms": 347990,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00127",
      "start_ms": 348310,
      "end_ms": 349490,
      "text": "又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00128",
      "start_ms": 349910,
      "end_ms": 350325,
      "text": "前阵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00129",
      "start_ms": 350460,
      "end_ms": 353745,
      "text": "那我翻到一本书正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00130",
      "start_ms": 354330,
      "end_ms": 359485,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00131",
      "start_ms": 359960,
      "end_ms": 364025,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00132",
      "start_ms": 364320,
      "end_ms": 366200,
      "text": "分成五块自然奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00133",
      "start_ms": 366500,
      "end_ms": 369390,
      "text": "文明印记、烟火人间秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00134",
      "start_ms": 369390,
      "end_ms": 371005,
      "text": "寻踪人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00135",
      "start_ms": 371670,
      "end_ms": 374615,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这些自然也都在里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00136",
      "start_ms": 375060,
      "end_ms": 377025,
      "text": "这些秋色是怎么形成的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00137",
      "start_ms": 377380,
      "end_ms": 379560,
      "text": "有什么故事去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00138",
      "start_ms": 379560,
      "end_ms": 382400,
      "text": "该看哪几处什么季节去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00139",
      "start_ms": 382400,
      "end_ms": 384230,
      "text": "最值几分钟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00140",
      "start_ms": 384270,
      "end_ms": 386470,
      "text": "一个地方讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00141",
      "start_ms": 386830,
      "end_ms": 388425,
      "text": "涂印的特别漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00142",
      "start_ms": 388900,
      "end_ms": 390885,
      "text": "一页翻开就是一幅画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00143",
      "start_ms": 391320,
      "end_ms": 393045,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00144",
      "start_ms": 393410,
      "end_ms": 396830,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00145",
      "start_ms": 396990,
      "end_ms": 397805,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00146",
      "start_ms": 398220,
      "end_ms": 400905,
      "text": "看的就不只是一片颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00147",
      "start_ms": 401230,
      "end_ms": 403990,
      "text": "而是故事暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00148",
      "start_ms": 404190,
      "end_ms": 405835,
      "text": "就着图文慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00149",
      "start_ms": 406190,
      "end_ms": 407185,
      "text": "也算去过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00150",
      "start_ms": 407640,
      "end_ms": 408945,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00151",
      "start_ms": 409680,
      "end_ms": 410840,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00152",
      "start_ms": 410860,
      "end_ms": 411755,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00153",
      "start_ms": 412140,
      "end_ms": 413385,
      "text": "长见识不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00154",
      "start_ms": 413990,
      "end_ms": 416265,
      "text": "写作文也正好用得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00155",
      "start_ms": 416930,
      "end_ms": 419330,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻翻商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00156",
      "start_ms": 419430,
      "end_ms": 422885,
      "text": "明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00157",
      "start_ms": 423340,
      "end_ms": 425935,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00158",
      "start_ms": 426710,
      "end_ms": 431885,
      "text": "可装在心里的山河眼界传几辈人都贬不了职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00159",
      "start_ms": 432550,
      "end_ms": 435070,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00160",
      "start_ms": 435070,
      "end_ms": 437210,
      "text": "也给下一代备一份书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00161",
      "start_ms": 437290,
      "end_ms": 438995,
      "text": "就在左下角的商品里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00162",
      "start_ms": 439790,
      "end_ms": 442035,
      "text": "感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00163",
      "start_ms": 442730,
      "end_ms": 444515,
      "text": "人暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00164",
      "start_ms": 445000,
      "end_ms": 447155,
      "text": "咱先把大好河山装进屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00165",
      "start_ms": 447540,
      "end_ms": 449315,
      "text": "好说回正题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00166",
      "start_ms": 450050,
      "end_ms": 450675,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00167",
      "start_ms": 451440,
      "end_ms": 455635,
      "text": "新疆喀纳斯湖与月亮湾乘雾阿尔泰山深处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00168",
      "start_ms": 456340,
      "end_ms": 457125,
      "text": "为什么是他？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00169",
      "start_ms": 457630,
      "end_ms": 460465,
      "text": "前面的风光各有各的绝活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00170",
      "start_ms": 461080,
      "end_ms": 462275,
      "text": "有的靠颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00171",
      "start_ms": 462860,
      "end_ms": 464055,
      "text": "有的靠雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00172",
      "start_ms": 464550,
      "end_ms": 465655,
      "text": "有的靠池水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00173",
      "start_ms": 466200,
      "end_ms": 469040,
      "text": "可喀纳斯把他们全装进了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00174",
      "start_ms": 469040,
      "end_ms": 469955,
      "text": "同一个清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00175",
      "start_ms": 470390,
      "end_ms": 476470,
      "text": "他在新疆阿勒泰地区布尔金县藏在阿尔泰山最深的山坳里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00176",
      "start_ms": 476970,
      "end_ms": 479090,
      "text": "湖面四十多平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00177",
      "start_ms": 479570,
      "end_ms": 481490,
      "text": "水深一百八十多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00178",
      "start_ms": 481910,
      "end_ms": 484490,
      "text": "湖水是冰川融水汇成的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00179",
      "start_ms": 484810,
      "end_ms": 487470,
      "text": "湖水里带着冰川磨出来的细粉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00180",
      "start_ms": 488390,
      "end_ms": 489390,
      "text": "光线一换，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00181",
      "start_ms": 489870,
      "end_ms": 490370,
      "text": "林子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00182",
      "start_ms": 490370,
      "end_ms": 492930,
      "text": "一黄水色也跟着换。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00183",
      "start_ms": 493350,
      "end_ms": 495490,
      "text": "一天里能变好几个颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00184",
      "start_ms": 495830,
      "end_ms": 497710,
      "text": "当地图瓦人还世代传说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00185",
      "start_ms": 498210,
      "end_ms": 499230,
      "text": "湖里有大怪兽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00186",
      "start_ms": 499230,
      "end_ms": 502640,
      "text": "有有人说是一种叫折罗龟的大鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00187",
      "start_ms": 502960,
      "end_ms": 504440,
      "text": "到今天也没个定论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00188",
      "start_ms": 504860,
      "end_ms": 506420,
      "text": "九月底十月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00189",
      "start_ms": 506820,
      "end_ms": 507360,
      "text": "秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00190",
      "start_ms": 507400,
      "end_ms": 516100,
      "text": "来的最早山坡上的白桦落叶松一起黄透金黄的林子沿着山坡铺到湖边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00191",
      "start_ms": 516860,
      "end_ms": 519260,
      "text": "可真正最神的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00192",
      "start_ms": 519400,
      "end_ms": 521020,
      "text": "清早天没亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00193",
      "start_ms": 521440,
      "end_ms": 523040,
      "text": "透山谷里起的雾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00194",
      "start_ms": 523440,
      "end_ms": 525860,
      "text": "一层一层从水面升上来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00195",
      "start_ms": 526140,
      "end_ms": 527000,
      "text": "漫过湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00196",
      "start_ms": 527400,
      "end_ms": 531090,
      "text": "漫过林子湖和天分看不出边界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00197",
      "start_ms": 531470,
      "end_ms": 535230,
      "text": "喀纳斯河在山谷里拐出一道月牙形的河湾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00198",
      "start_ms": 535410,
      "end_ms": 538210,
      "text": "这就是月亮湾雾绕着河湾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00199",
      "start_ms": 538770,
      "end_ms": 541630,
      "text": "金黄的林子从雾里露出头来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00200",
      "start_ms": 542050,
      "end_ms": 542890,
      "text": "他排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00201",
      "start_ms": 543190,
      "end_ms": 545390,
      "text": "不是比谁最高最大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00202",
      "start_ms": 545850,
      "end_ms": 549110,
      "text": "而是因为只有他把冰川的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00203",
      "start_ms": 549830,
      "end_ms": 555090,
      "text": "原始的林河湾和晨雾一起留在了一个清晨里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00204",
      "start_ms": 555450,
      "end_ms": 557190,
      "text": "十处绝美秋色讲完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00205",
      "start_ms": 557370,
      "end_ms": 558750,
      "text": "最后把问题交给您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00206",
      "start_ms": 559430,
      "end_ms": 561760,
      "text": "这十处秋景您去过几处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00207",
      "start_ms": 562060,
      "end_ms": 563500,
      "text": "最想去的是哪一处？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00208",
      "start_ms": 563740,
      "end_ms": 564820,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00209",
      "start_ms": 565140,
      "end_ms": 573440,
      "text": "刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品里就有爱看大好河山的朋友别错过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00210",
      "start_ms": 574080,
      "end_ms": 576180,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00211",
      "start_ms": 576620,
      "end_ms": 579060,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00212",
      "start_ms": 579240,
      "end_ms": 580900,
      "text": "爱看祖国山河的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00213",
      "start_ms": 581320,
      "end_ms": 584860,
      "text": "觉听更多华夏大地的绝美风景点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e131f0a2f28e29a1_s00214",
      "start_ms": 585140,
      "end_ms": 586745,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
